ance.\",\n    \"No application files were changed, endpoints called, real credentials accessed or OS permissions granted. C26/P08 controller and release gates remain separate. The read-only sandbox prevents writing the designated artifact; this returned JSON is the verdict.\"\n  ],\n  \"inspected_files\": [\n    \"AGENTS.md\",\n    \"GLOSSARY.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/reviews/C31/attempt-07/request.json\",\n    \"docs/planning/reviews/C31/attempt-07/source-inventory.json\",\n    \"docs/planning/reviews/C31/attempt-05/verdict-returned.json\",\n    \"docs/planning/reviews/C31/attempt-06/verdict-returned.json\",\n    \"docs/planning/reviews/C31/attempt-06/acceptance.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/chunks/C31.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/review-protocol.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/decisions.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/dependencies.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/parity-matrix.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/test-catalogue.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/status.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/WORF-START-HERE.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/C30-owner-score-override-2026-11-02.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/C31-conditional-owner-override-2026-11-02.md\",\n    \"docs/adr/0001-native-operation-authority.md\",\n    \"docs/adr/0002-academy-shared-presentation.md\",\n    \"docs/adr/0003-native-harness-and-scoped-identity.md\",\n    \"docs/adr/0004-managed-workbench-admission.md\",\n    \"docs/architecture/review-verdict.schema.json\",\n    \"docs/architecture/checks.json\",\n    \"docs/architecture/native-checks.json\",\n    \"docs/architecture/inputs.lock.json\",\n    \"docs/architecture/ui-v2/DESIGN-V2.md\",\n    \"docs/architecture/ui-v2/invariants.md\",\n    \"docs/architecture/ui-v2/state-ownership.md\",\n    \"docs/architecture/ui-v2/screens/reviews-administration.md\",\n    \"docs/architecture/ui-v2/screens/administration-inventory.md\",\n    \"docs/architecture/ui-v2/screens/boards.md\",\n    \"docs/architecture/ui-v2/provenance.md\",\n    \"docs/architecture/