 \"docs/planning/evidence/P09/native/cumulative/C38/native/captures/harness-ring-action.png\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"limitations\": [\n    \"Pixels come from the fixture build's own WKWebView snapshot; the parity composites put the prototype board (rendered at the WebView's measured size) beside it.\",\n    \"The model is the synthetic Gateway service (tools/native-acceptance/mgmt_server.py); the real pinned engine runs against it. The lifecycle fixtures and the setup panels are exercised in the component suite.\",\n    \"Spoken VoiceOver output was not recorded.\"\n  ],\n  \"screens\": [\n    \"harness-decision-dark-100.png\",\n    \"harness-decision-dark-200.png\",\n    \"harness-decision-light-100.png\",\n    \"harness-decision-light-200.png\",\n    \"harness-empty-dark-100.png\",\n    \"harness-empty-dark-200.png\",\n    \"harness-empty-light-100.png\",\n    \"harness-empty-light-200.png\",\n    \"harness-guard-light.png\",\n    \"harness-ring-focused.png\",\n    \"harness-ring-plain.png\",\n    \"layouts-harness-1440x900-dark.png\",\n    \"layouts-harness-1440x900-light.png\",\n    \"layouts-harness-900x600-200-dark.png\",\n    \"layouts-harness-900x600-200-light.png\"\n  ]\n}\n{\n  \"schema\": \"airs-v2/p09-native-execution/1\",\n  \"phase\": \"P09\",\n  \"driver_subject\": \"C38\",\n  \"orchestrator\": \"Codex\",\n  \"started_utc\": \"2026-11-02T16:27:47.732785+00:00\",\n  \"finished_utc\": \"2026-11-02T16:32:16.959234+00:00\",\n  \"source_root\": \"/Users/cdot/development/redtail/prisma-airs-desktop-v2-current\",\n  \"source_head\": \"9569a34ac5bd22862ed5e46be4a6f0381eddb36f\",\n  \"os\": \"macOS-26.6.2-arm64-arm-64bit-Mach-O\",\n  \"driver_return_code\": 0,\n  \"executable_sha256\": \"38a08638a5e8bf27d65d5fbf9ac28ec042f684114e6df7025aa30ad8de201e72\",\n  \"raw_record_sha256\": \"a8ca695cea267e7adbe64fcf28f1244159f32c62a823d887030c8677aa0ce8ef\",\n  \"controller_sha256\": \"d438ad8be0bf88edae91b5180c896adfb6365b701e06c21c7226747300bd2743\",\n  \"requirem