t the first actual completed post-fix review after attempt06. Any score below9 activates separate source/evidence/audit-bound ownerall9 completion, even with blockers; raw verdict/receipt/audit/arrays stay unchanged. No further C31 scoring cycles or reopening the same findings through P09 are authorized after that review. C32/P09 actual full9 remain required. C30/C41 owner decisions remain separate; no C30 code/coverage/captures/performance/tests/re-review occur.\n\nG8 application/native19/check18 are archived unchanged, including the exact full app bundle. The two large archived executable files use additive explicit LFS rules; no archived app bytes are altered. The original G8 driver-only equivalence probe results remain historical for their exact G8 application. Current generic source-transition guards and owner-cap guards apply to G9; the changed production callback behavior requires freshly built current qualification. No application or native pass is transferred from G8. No live product calls, real credentials, installation, signing or publication occur.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
